---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate disclosure"
  description="How this site uses affiliate and partner links, and how commissions work."
  canonicalPath="/disclosure/"
>
  <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Some links on this site are <strong>affiliate</strong> or <strong>partner</strong> links.
      If you click and buy or sign up, I may earn a commission at <strong>no extra cost to you</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
      As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. Sephora and other retailer links may
      use partner networks (for example LinkShare / Rakuten via Linktree wrappers). Tool links such as
      Rytr may use that vendor’s referral parameter.
    </p>
    <p>
      Affiliate links are marked in HTML with <code>rel="sponsored nofollow"</code> so search engines
      treat them as paid/commercial relationships per Google’s qualifying-link guidance.
    </p>
    <p>
      Opinions are my own. Free-tier limits, prices, and program terms change — always verify on the
      merchant’s site before you buy or rely on a tool for client work.
    </p>
    <p>
      Questions: use the contact method on my
      <a href="https://linktr.ee/chadd990" rel="noopener">Linktree</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
